NAME       : mach
VERSION    : 3.3.0-a7.0
BUILD      : 
DESCRIPTION: MACH chemistry library
SUMMARY    : Atmospheric gas and aerosol chemistry module within RPN physics. This replaces the rpnphy_chm_stubs library within rpnphy. This library also carries some modifications of base rpnphy codes under src/gemmod directory. These are listed explicitly in 'GEMMOD_OBJ_FILES' and used in final linking of the executable.
MAINTAINER : ECCC/S&T/ASTD/AQRI
URL        : https://gitlab.science.gc.ca/ARQI-GEMMACH
DOC        : https://wiki.cmc.ec.gc.ca/wiki/GEMMACH

